{"title":"Thursday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/972095711/0/marginalrevolution~Thursday-assorted-links.html","date":1793290761000,"content":"<p>1. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/TheDunkCentral/status/2115514904023343245\" target=\"_blank\">A whopping 79 NBA players are listed on today’s 2:30 PM injury report for tonight’s games. That’s roughly 15% of the entire league</a>”  This is just week one people!  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/csteed/status/2115495864454275108\" target=\"_blank\">some commentary</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2eXfqovkim4\" target=\"_blank\">Video making the case that AI has been fine for jobs</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://jacobin.com/2026/10/china-mieville-rouse-ghosts-cold-war\" target=\"_blank\">John Repetti reviews The Rouse at Jacobin</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/28/opinion/tiktok-politics-social-media-hopescroll.html\" target=\"_blank\">Is TikTok now encouraging more optimistic content?</a> (NYT)  Big if true, I am not currently active on the platform and do not have an opinion on the matter.  In any case worth a read.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://blog.andymasley.com/p/some-favorite-lesser-known-books\" target=\"_blank\">Andy Masley recommends some lesser-known books</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://openai.com/index/chatgpt-expanding-world-of-work/\" target=\"_blank\">New OpenAI dataset on how people use ChatGPT</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/PhilWMagness/status/2115812484032393689\" target=\"_blank\">Piketty-Saez-Zucman biases found earlier by humans</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://grok.com/share/bGVnYWN5LWNvcHk_70daff7f-d732-48e5-b609-ff14ef2ff941\" target=\"_blank\">an audit from Grok on whether the initial AI report is capturing the major problems</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/thursday-assorted-links-576.html\">Thursday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/972095711/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/972095711/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/972095711/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/972095711/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/972095711/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/972095711/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/thursday-assorted-links-576.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/thursday-assorted-links-576.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/thursda